---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import fface from "../assets/img/fface.png";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="home" desc="hey there" pageId="hometitle">
	<style>
		:root {
			--main-color: #5ac26a;
		}
		#abouttext {
			width: 90%;
			height: 20%;
			outline: 1px dotted var(--main-color);
			padding: 12px;
		}

		#hometitle:before {
			content: "⌂ ";
			color: #5ac26a;
		}

		#home:before {
			content: "⌂ ";
			color: var(--main-color);
		}
	</style>
	<h1 id="hometitle">home</h1>
	<h4>hey there</h4>

	<div id="abouttext">
		<p><span class="about-thing">⌂ </span>rennes, fr</p>

		<p>
			<span class="about-thing">✉ </span>
			<a
				href="https://post.lurk.org/@Lime"
				class="external-link"
				target="_blank">mastodon</a
			> ~ <a
				href="https://bsky.app/profile/l68k.com"
				class="external-link"
				target="_blank">bluesky</a
			> ~ <a
				href="https://instagram.com/lime68k"
				class="external-link"
				target="_blank">instagram</a
			>
		</p>

		<p>
			<span class="about-thing">♫ </span><a
				class="external-link"
				href="https://lime68k.bandcamp.com/">bandcamp</a
			> ~ <a
				class="external-link"
				href="https://mirlo.space/lime68k/releases">mirlo</a
			> ~

			<a class="external-link" href="https://soundcloud.com/lime68k/"
				>soundcloud</a
			> ~ <a class="external-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/@lime68k"
				>youtube</a
			>
		</p>

		<p>
			i'm camille, aka lime68k and 1x1. i make sound and visual things,
			mostly through software like <a
				href="https://cycling74.com/products/max"
				class="external-link">max</a
			>, <a href="https://www.ableton.com/" class="external-link"
				>ableton</a
			>, <a href="https://tidalcycles.org/" class="external-link"
				>tidalcycles</a
			> and <a
				href="https://www.blender.org/"
				target="_blank"
				class="external-link">blender</a
			>.
		</p>
		<p>
			on this website there's a <a href="portfolio" class="internal-link"
				>portfolio</a
			> and a <a href="gallery" class="internal-link">gallery</a> for visual
			stuff, things i <a href="entries" class="internal-link">wrote</a> (mostly
			reviews as of feb 25), lists of different <a
				href="things"
				class="internal-link">things</a
			>, a <a href="streams" class="internal-link">weird place</a> and weird
			<a href="bidules" class="internal-link">bidules</a>.
		</p>

		<Image
			src={fface}
			style="object-fit: contain;width: 100%;height: auto;"
			alt="me"
		/>
	</div>

	<h5>
		website font: VG5000 by Justin Bihan. Distributed by <a
			href="https://velvetyne.fr/"
			target="_blank"
			class="external-link">velvetyne.fr</a
		>.
	</h5>
</BaseLayout>
